# Statistics — API.md §Statistics
#
# Product data (what the household did), as opposed to `telemetry.http` which
# is ops telemetry (what the engine did). There is no per-query HTTP endpoint:
# individual events are on `WS /api/v1/events` — see the README.

@base = {{host}}/api/v1
@auth = Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Aggregated stats over a rolling 24h window: totals, block rate, cache hit
### rate, top domains and clients, plus time buckets for charting.
GET {{base}}/stats
{{auth}}

### The same payload the websocket pushes every 2 s. Worth one HTTP call at
### dashboard start-up so the first paint does not wait for that tick.
GET {{base}}/stats
{{auth}}
